## 5.1 Make saving reliable

When a student saves attendance:

1. Validate the authenticated student identity.
2. Validate the session ID and class eligibility according to existing rules.
3. Validate required fields without discarding the user's entered data.
4. Save the photo using the existing supported storage mechanism.
