If an atomic operation is required to prevent partial state, use a transaction or another appropriate Firebase-supported strategy. Remember that Firestore transactions have restrictions on external side effects; do not upload a photo inside a transaction callback. Use a safe upload-and-commit workflow with cleanup or retry handling for incomplete uploads.

## 5.2 Avoid misleading optimistic success

The interface may optimistically display a pending state, but it must distinguish that from a cloud-confirmed status.

